<title>USA: MAF Bancorp Inc Q2 Dec 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>MAF Bancorp Inc Q2 Dec 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CLARENDON HILLS, Ill. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.83		   $ 0.61</p>
<p> Net			  9,113		    3,595</p>
<p>	  SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		     $   0.81		   $ 1.33</p>
<p> Net			  8,775		    7,815</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,855		    5,862</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: MAF Bancorp changed its reporting year to end December 31 from a June 30 end, effective for the period ended December 31, 1996. This report covers the &quot;stub&quot; period.</p>
<p>1996 six months net includes after-tax charge of $8.7 million from government assessment to recapitalize the deposit insurance fund for savings institutions.</p>
<p>1995 Q2 and six months net includes charge equal to $0.08 a share from early retirement of debt.</p>
<p>Assets $3.2 billion</p>
<p>Loans $2.4 billion</p>
<p>Deposits $2.3 billion</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
